@startuml sequence_plagiarism_scan
autonumber
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

title Sequence Diagram: End-to-End Document Plagiarism Scan Workflow

actor User as "Student / Researcher"
participant SPA as "React SPA (Client)"
participant BFF as "Node.js Express Gateway"
participant Redis as "Redis (BullMQ & PubSub)"
participant AI as "FastAPI AI Engine"
participant Extractor as "PDF Parser & Chunker"
participant VectorDB as "ChromaDB"
participant LangGraph as "LangGraph Multi-Agent"
database Mongo as "MongoDB"

User -> SPA: 1. Drag & Drop PDF Document
SPA -> BFF: 2. POST /api/v1/documents/upload (Multipart, JWT)
BFF -> BFF: 3. Verify JWT, Tenant, Quota & MIME Magic Bytes
BFF -> BFF: 4. Compute SHA-256 Digest
BFF -> Mongo: 5. Insert Document Record (Status: 'QUEUED')
BFF -> Redis: 6. Enqueue Job 'scan-document' {docId, fileUri, tenantId}
BFF --> SPA: 7. HTTP 202 Accepted {jobId, docId, status: 'QUEUED'}

SPA -> BFF: 8. GET /api/v1/jobs/{jobId}/events (SSE Connection)
BFF -> Redis: 9. Subscribe to Redis Channel `job:{jobId}:progress`

Redis -> AI: 10. Worker pops 'scan-document' job
AI -> Redis: 11. Publish Progress Event {stage: 'EXTRACTING', pct: 15}
Redis -> BFF: 12. Forward Event
BFF -> SPA: 13. SSE Push {stage: 'EXTRACTING', pct: 15}

AI -> Extractor: 14. Parse PDF text & layout (pdfplumber)
Extractor --> AI: 15. Extracted text & section boundaries
AI -> Extractor: 16. Recursive Token Chunking (500 tokens, 50 overlap)
Extractor --> AI: 17. Chunks [c1, c2, ... cN]

AI -> Redis: 18. Publish Progress Event {stage: 'EMBEDDING', pct: 40}
Redis -> BFF: 19. Forward Event
BFF -> SPA: 20. SSE Push {stage: 'EMBEDDING', pct: 40}

AI -> AI: 21. Compute 384-dim Dense Vectors (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)
AI -> VectorDB: 22. Upsert Chunks with Tenant Metadata {tenant_id, doc_id}

AI -> Redis: 23. Publish Progress Event {stage: 'AGENTIC_ANALYSIS', pct: 70}
Redis -> BFF: 24. Forward Event
BFF -> SPA: 25. SSE Push {stage: 'AGENTIC_ANALYSIS', pct: 70}

AI -> LangGraph: 26. Initialize State & Run Agentic Pipeline
activate LangGraph
LangGraph -> LangGraph: 27. Planner Agent: Route sub-tasks
LangGraph -> VectorDB: 28. Plagiarism Agent: k-NN similarity queries
VectorDB --> LangGraph: 29. Matched Corpus Chunks (Score >= 0.75)
LangGraph -> LangGraph: 30. Grammar & Citation Agents: Linguistic & DOI auditing
LangGraph -> LangGraph: 31. Synthesis Agent: Aggregate report & Integrity Score
LangGraph --> AI: 32. Final Structured Analysis JSON
deactivate LangGraph

AI -> Mongo: 33. Save AnalysisReport & Update Document (Status: 'COMPLETED')
AI -> Redis: 34. Publish Event {stage: 'COMPLETED', reportId: '...'}
Redis -> BFF: 35. Forward Event
BFF -> SPA: 36. SSE Push {stage: 'COMPLETED', reportId: '...'}

SPA -> BFF: 37. GET /api/v1/reports/{reportId}
BFF -> Mongo: 38. Query Report by ID & Tenant
Mongo --> BFF: 39. Return Report Document
BFF --> SPA: 40. HTTP 200 OK (Render Interactive Report)
SPA --> User: 41. Displays Plagiarism %, Grammar Highlights, Citation Diffs

@enduml
